<title>MALAYSIA: Hospital Pantai holder seeks stake.</title>
<headline>Hospital Pantai holder seeks stake.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hospital Pantai Bhd said on Friday that it is in talks with a shareholder of the company who is seeking to acquire a &quot;substantial stake&quot; in its stock.</p>
<p>The hospitals operator gave no further details in the statement, which was sent to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange. It also asked that the exchange extend a trading suspension in its shares until further notice.</p>
<p>Shares of Hospital Pantai last traded at 11.10 ringgit on October 22.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
